  "narration": [
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-1",
      "transcript": "He survived an atomic bomb. Three days later, he survived another.",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 4.675,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.d9444d9cab160f4f22ba31db6c22cfed384b1f7a60950ee7c1ce6ee6ee424efa",
        "sha256": "d9444d9cab160f4f22ba31db6c22cfed384b1f7a60950ee7c1ce6ee6ee424efa"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-2",
      "transcript": "This is Tsutomu Yamaguchi, a Mitsubishi shipbuilding engineer.",
      "start": 4.866666666666666,
      "duration": 4.45,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.f0e6122d97af7a1edc7c8a5d8391da90a2648fb7d5d4db328432d1a75c94a98d",
        "sha256": "f0e6122d97af7a1edc7c8a5d8391da90a2648fb7d5d4db328432d1a75c94a98d"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-3",
      "transcript": "August sixth, nineteen forty-five. He was in Hiroshima on business when the United States dropped an atomic bomb.",
      "start": 9.5,
      "duration": 7.6,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.2d633821c57b252a7b3bc3f877380615a0893d1c3eba154afcd0e1e4e26c130d",
        "sha256": "2d633821c57b252a7b3bc3f877380615a0893d1c3eba154afcd0e1e4e26c130d"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-4",
      "transcript": "Severely burned, he survived.",
      "start": 17.266666666666666,
      "duration": 2.475,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.cdbc789684c8e88f6faac3977d074028740ce273b3b74b59444521dbd5c5229a",
        "sha256": "cdbc789684c8e88f6faac3977d074028740ce273b3b74b59444521dbd5c5229a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-5",
      "transcript": "The next day, he boarded a train. It carried him home to Nagasaki.",
      "start": 20.133333333333333,
      "duration": 4.475,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.6e3f649c60d9416c6ffd8868b422e8684dfbbee08d2f49780cf67e087809cfd2",
        "sha256": "6e3f649c60d9416c6ffd8868b422e8684dfbbee08d2f49780cf67e087809cfd2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-6",
      "transcript": "On August ninth, he was back at work. He recalled describing Hiroshima to his manager.",
      "start": 27.5,
      "duration": 5.925,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.252e48acbc3fd6e84e675b314f757311da6fd92629ef164dd7efddb0aab3f9fa",
        "sha256": "252e48acbc3fd6e84e675b314f757311da6fd92629ef164dd7efddb0aab3f9fa"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-7",
      "transcript": "Then came another flash. The second atomic bomb had struck.",
      "start": 33.8,
      "duration": 4.175,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.060294728f4afd6ac101dc2b08bcfede769342ecfcc11d524675d2602dc97932",
        "sha256": "060294728f4afd6ac101dc2b08bcfede769342ecfcc11d524675d2602dc97932"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-8",
      "transcript": "He survived again. His wife and infant son survived too.",
      "start": 38.36666666666667,
      "duration": 4.25,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.f3f2a2f42f3658539d22adbb1bf773c6f09b6e392f5ecf231234abae0cc67f3e",
        "sha256": "f3f2a2f42f3658539d22adbb1bf773c6f09b6e392f5ecf231234abae0cc67f3e"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-9",
      "transcript": "The bombings killed tens of thousands and left lasting suffering.",
      "start": 42.8,
      "duration": 4.35,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.d4e3d930fa5fde8afbe6a11e2ae103e5ac368cdfd77246129b2dccf41acd6ea1",
        "sha256": "d4e3d930fa5fde8afbe6a11e2ae103e5ac368cdfd77246129b2dccf41acd6ea1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-10",
      "transcript": "In two thousand nine, Japan officially recognized his exposure in both cities.",
      "start": 47.53333333333333,
      "duration": 5.6,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.11367cde0fc93bc4c0ab8a2ca5244a3d6ebd9461900f021f5a50ab709be71577",
        "sha256": "11367cde0fc93bc4c0ab8a2ca5244a3d6ebd9461900f021f5a50ab709be71577"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-11",
      "transcript": "He was not the only double survivor.",
      "start": 53.3,
      "duration": 2.575,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.a0974fb3408185c74fda3e9838a2ad17dce7a43158e57b5985aa0986d4598cbd",
        "sha256": "a0974fb3408185c74fda3e9838a2ad17dce7a43158e57b5985aa0986d4598cbd"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-12",
      "transcript": "He lived until twenty ten, aged ninety-three.",
      "start": 56.266666666666666,
      "duration": 3.325,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.9c5a423c63fab57a8ee3d2e65613c3ddeb9549d124d50c0cc687391872114b69",
        "sha256": "9c5a423c63fab57a8ee3d2e65613c3ddeb9549d124d50c0cc687391872114b69"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "yamaguchi-two-bombs-cue-13",
      "transcript": "In later years, he urged the world to abolish nuclear weapons.",
      "start": 59.766666666666666,
      "duration": 4.225,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.26501a5227bdc025202a9a8e3b0dc20eba8ade868154068afb054362905cad8d",
        "sha256": "26501a5227bdc025202a9a8e3b0dc20eba8ade868154068afb054362905cad8d"
      }
    }
